From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:41:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Pet Shop & Sticker Book: one grade at a time

The book had a tab for every shop in every grade (13 tabs). Now a grade
switch sits on top (4th grade / 6th grade) and only that grade's shops
show as tabs. It opens on the grade the student is standing in.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014wQFE2KZBjkYxaH2m8t9SR
